; Tutorial_8_Ask_with_SQL.inix -- questions in SQL.

[about]
Title=8 - Ask with SQL
Intro=A question in the database's own language with Control plus Q, the answer shown as records, and the history of questions asked.
Setup=JobTrail is open in DbDo.
Homework=Write a query that counts your records by one column.

[step]

Say=One want: an answer no single command gives -- how many jobs at each employer, most first. SQL, the database's own language, asks it in one line.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Alt plus Control plus D, D for DbDo, opens it or brings it forward.
Key=Alt+Control+D
Hear=DbDo
Hear=DbDo ready

[step]

Say=Control plus Q, Q for Query, opens a box for SQL.
Key=Control+Q
Hear=Query dialog
Hear=SQL: edit, multiline
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I type the question.
Key=select employer, count(*) as jobs from jobs group by employer order by jobs desc
Hear=(each word echoed as it is typed)

[step]

Say=Control plus Enter runs it from inside the box, where Enter would start a new line.
Key=Control+Enter
Hear=(the first row of the answer)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=The answer is shown as records, moved through like any table. Shift plus Q says the query in force.
Key=Shift+Q
Hear=(the query)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A planned misstep: a misspelled column. The database says which word it does not know, and the box keeps the query to fix.
Key=Control+Q
Hear=Query dialog
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Escape. Alt plus Shift plus Q, the history, lists the questions asked, to run one again.
Key=Alt+Shift+Q
Hear=Query History
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I name the command; the reader gives the key.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Ask in SQL.
Key=
Hear=Control plus Q

[step]

Say=Run it from inside the box.
Key=
Hear=Control plus Enter

[step]

Say=The questions asked before.
Key=
Hear=Alt plus Shift plus Q
